OL,4,CSecurity flaw found in Java, world's   
OL,5,Cthird-largest programming language     
OL,6,GA cyber-security firm has used         
OL,7,Gartificial intelligence (AI) to        
OL,8,Guncover a critical flaw in the hugely  
OL,9,Gpopular computer programming language  
OL,10,GJava.                                  
OL,12,FTech start-up Calif - which recently   
OL,13,Fidentified a cyber-security flaw in    
OL,14,Fanother language, PHP - found the bug  
OL,15,Fin Java's memory functions.            
OL,17,FJava is a popular programming language 
OL,18,Fused by nearly all of the world's top  
OL,19,Fcompanies such as Apple and Amazon, as 
OL,20,Fwell as many banks, hospitals and      
OL,21,Fgovernments.                           
